    <item>
      <title>Transcriptomic analysis of the human habenula in schizophrenia</title>
      <link>https://lcolladotor.github.io/publication/2025_11_habenulapilot/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://lcolladotor.github.io/publication/2025_11_habenulapilot/</guid>
      <description>&lt;blockquote class=&#34;twitter-tweet&#34;&gt;&lt;p lang=&#34;en&#34; dir=&#34;ltr&#34;&gt;I’m excited to share our first human habenula study comparing transcriptomic data from neurotypical control postmortem tissue and schizophrenia cases! 🧠 &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/hashtag/HabenulaLIBD?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;#HabenulaLIBD&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/hashtag/snRNAseq?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;#snRNAseq&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/hashtag/Habenula?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;#Habenula&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is my first paper as co-corresponding author!&lt;br&gt;📎 &lt;a href=&#34;https://t.co/tePWIaSQXB&#34;&gt;https://t.co/tePWIaSQXB&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://t.co/M2CTDRKz3O&#34;&gt;pic.twitter.com/M2CTDRKz3O&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Louise Huuki-Myers (@lahuuki) &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/lahuuki/status/1765799542463635679?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;March 7, 2024&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src=&#34;https://platform.x.com/widgets.js&#34; charset=&#34;utf-8&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;blockquote class=&#34;twitter-tweet&#34;&gt;&lt;p lang=&#34;en&#34; dir=&#34;ltr&#34;&gt;It&amp;#39;s great to see &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/hashtag/HabenulaLIBD?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;#HabenulaLIBD&lt;/a&gt; on &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/biorxivpreprint?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;@biorxivpreprint&lt;/a&gt; and be publicly accessible to you. It&amp;#39;s a major milestone (peer review is next 🤞🏽)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;It also feels like the end of a large cycle. At the same time, it&amp;#39;s the start of Hb 🧠work we are pursuing with &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/kr_maynard?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;@kr_maynard&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/LieberInstitute?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;@LieberInstitute&lt;/a&gt; 🔬 &lt;a href=&#34;https://t.co/UbFpYwdRtx&#34;&gt;pic.twitter.com/UbFpYwdRtx&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; 🇲🇽 Leonardo Collado-Torres (@lcolladotor) &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/lcolladotor/status/1765872123766264283?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;March 7, 2024&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src=&#34;https://platform.x.com/widgets.js&#34; charset=&#34;utf-8&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
</description>
    </item>
    
